n":4.041667},"3365e673e580":{"text":"Maybe, but it will be worth it.","id":"3365e673e580","source":"BTS 14 · #98","image":"/img/scene-clips/7384.webp","imageBytes":24644,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7384.mp4","videoBytes":139743,"duration":4.041667},"25ed798430fe":{"text":"What classes will you have tomorrow?","id":"25ed798430fe","source":"BTS 14 · #39","image":"/img/scene-clips/7492.webp","imageBytes":22950,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7492.mp4","videoBytes":131771,"duration":4.041667},"3af57a434bd7":{"text":"Will you play outside during recess?","id":"3af57a434bd7","source":"BTS 14 · #47","image":"/img/scene-clips/7493.webp","imageBytes":19498,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7493.mp4","videoBytes":316478,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["What classes will you have tomorrow?","We will go to the beach this summer.","I will go to school tomorrow.","I will not do my work tomorrow. I will do it now!","What will he eat tomorrow? He will eat spaghetti.","Will you play outside during recess?","She will not play video games tomorrow.","What will he do this weekend?","He will play soccer this weekend.","Do you think he will win?","Who is going to be sixteen years old on Saturday?","When will the party start?","What will everyone eat at the party?","I will study hard for the test.","She will visit her grandmother next week.","They will have a big dinner tonight.","Will you come to my birthday party?","I am going to play with my friends.","Yes, I will finish it soon.","Will you finish your homework before dinner?","What will you wear to school tomorrow?","I will wear my favorite shirt.","Will it rain tomorrow?","I think it will be sunny.","What time will you wake up tomorrow?","I will wake up at seven in the morning.","Will you eat breakfast?","Yes, I always eat a good breakfast.","What will you have to drink?","I will drink milk with my breakfast.","Will you walk to school?","No, my mother will drive me.","How long will the drive take?","It will take about twenty minutes.","Will you be late?","No, I will arrive on time.","I will have math, science, and English.","Which class will be the most difficult?","I think math will be challenging.","Yes, I will try my best.","What will you do at lunch?","I will sit with my friends and eat.","Yes, if the weather is nice.","What game will you play?","We will probably play basketball.","Will you score any points?","I hope I will score a few goals.","Will the team win?","I will go to the library.","Will you borrow any books?","Yes, I will look for a mystery book.","How long will you stay there?","I will stay for about an hour.","Will you come home for dinner?","Yes, I will be home by six o'clock.","What will your family eat for dinner?","We will have grilled chicken and vegetables.","Will you help cook?","I will help set the table.","I will watch some television.","What show will you watch?","I will watch my favorite comedy show.","Yes, I will do it before bed.","Will you go to bed early?","Yes, I need to get enough sleep.","Will you get tired?","Will you read before sleeping?","I will read the science fiction book.","Will you have any dreams tonight?","What will happen next week?","I will have a field trip to the museum.","Will the trip be fun?","Yes, I think it will be very interesting.","How long will the trip last?","It will last the whole day.","Will you bring your camera?","Yes, I will take lots of pictures.","I will see dinosaur fossils and ancient artifacts.","Yes, I expect to learn many new things.","Will you learn something new?","Maybe, but it will be worth it.","Will you tell your family about it?","Of course, I will tell them all about it."]}
